SUMMARY:Thursday YOGA
DESCRIPTION:What could be more fun than enjoying yoga in the vineyard?!  Join us once/month for this summer series\, provided by Twisted Fitness.  $20 includes 1 hour vinyasa practice and your first glass of wine or beer of choice. The tasting room is open until 9pm\, so feel free to stay afterwards to enjoy social time with friends! \n[boxbtn align=”center” color=”white-black” custom_class=”box-btn-mt box-btn-mr box-btn-ml box-btn-mb” link=”https://www.eventbrite.com/e/yoga-in-the-vineyard-tickets-1985636868325?aff=oddtdtcreator&fbclid=IwY2xjawQux7ZleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFjZTlLUjhRd0VjNjdZRzN3c3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHiB1_6aGf25wHOMiL74Zh2S6qwiZGNjDNmHjwqQtwy33qjNev1
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/thursday-yoga-5/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/YogaJuly.jpg
END:VEVENT
