SUMMARY:Live Music! Wine by the Vine [ON DECK] at grandview with 3 West
DESCRIPTION:Join us for LIVE music on Friday & Saturday evenings from 6:00 pm – 8:30 pm. Experience joy and laughter with friends over a glass of your favorite wine\, local beer or specialty cocktails. Come rain or shine. Music will move inside in the case of inclement weather.  $8 admission for the deck from 5-9pm or buy a deck pass to enjoy live music\, all summer long! We are open 12:00 pm – 9:00 pm Fridays and Saturdays\, so plan to arrive early as seating is first come first serve. Food is available for purchase or you may bring your own. Beverages are available for purchase until 8:30 pm. No open bottles will be sold after 8:30 pm.
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/live-music-wine-by-the-vine-on-deck-at-grandview-4-2026-07-10/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Wine-By-the-Vine-Deck-Series-10.jpg
END:VEVENT
