SUMMARY:Fête en Blanc 2026 at grandview
DESCRIPTION:Grandview Fête en Blanc 2026\nJuly 25\, 2026 | 5:00pm-9:00pm\nCome celebrate summer at the classiest outdoor party in the area! \nClick Here to Purchase Tickets \nWhat is Fête en Blanc?\nFête en Blanc is the premiere outdoor dining party celebrated worldwide. Fête encourages guests to don their finest all white attire\, pack their own outdoor picnic complete with tableware + decor\, and join their friends\, family\, and neighbors for an unforgettable evening of dining al fresco\, entertainment and dancing.\nEntertainment by DJ Party Mike! \n\n\nDETAILS:Tickets to Grandview Fête en Blanc 2026 will be sold in General Admission and Grandview Gold Sponsor levels. All tickets sold include seating for up to 6 guests with table\, chairs\, and white linen provided.  Guests are encouraged to carpool.  \n\n\nTickets are RAIN or SHINE.  No refunds will be awarded for any reason for tickets purchased. Tents are not permitted. Please note that by purchasing a ticket\, you and your guests give permission to be photographed for promotional purposes during the Grandview Vineyard Fête en Blanc event on July 25\, 2026*\n\n\n \n\nGeneral Admission Tickets $180\nIncludes tickets for 6 people ($30/person)\, Table\, 6 chairs and white table cloth.\n  \nSPONSOR OPPORTUNITIES AVAILABLE. Email sarah@grandviewwines.com for details. \n \nGrandview Gold Sponsor $1000\n-Early Admission with reserved seating\n-6 VIP tickets\, VIP bar with wristbands including OPEN BAR for cocktail hour 4:30-5:30pm\n-Table\, 6 chairs\, white table cloth\, white cloth napkins & a beautiful floral centerpiece by Bixler Blooms.\n-Logo on display at the event\, included on the event registration page\, social media\, and newsletter marketing AND mention at the event! \nClick Here to Purchase Tickets \nDon’t want to pack your own food? \nYou’re in luck…\nKelSas Sweetbox will be onsite during the event\, offering individual Charcuterie Boxes $18 OR you can PRE-ORDER “The Blanc Board” for $40\n-10″ charcuterie that are sharable and will highlight the event’s theme with white cheeses\, fresh herbs\, and bright\, beautiful accents.\nPRE-ORDER HERE
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/fete-en-blanc-2025-at-grandview/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/GrandviewFete26.jpg
END:VEVENT
